	"comment": "The pi-durable carrier: what it is emitted from, what it is, and the published SDK set it runs against. The experimental durable app is source-only upstream (published pi-coding-agent ships no dist/experimental), so Entwurf owns its thin application/TUI composition as canonical source (pi/pi-durable/src) and ships it as a CARRIER: those files, type-stripped, with the relocation in pi/pi-durable/carrier-relocation.mjs. The SDK engine (execution, scheduler, queues, storage/transcript, compaction, cancellation/recovery, providers, auth) stays the published packages in `sdk`. scripts/emit-pi-durable-carrier.ts is the only writer of the generated fields (carrier blob, sha256, emitter.node); an installed package never reads source. Model data rides the published @earendil-works/pi-ai.",
